   426	 * Effect cannot convert fails construction with `InvalidJournalConfig`.
   427	 *
   428	 * **Example** (Bound journal shutdown)
   429	 * ```ts import.meta.vitest name="Bound journal shutdown"
   430	 * import { JournalConfig } from "@beep/scratchpad/effected/jsonl/index";
   431	 * import * as Duration from "effect/Duration";
   432	 * const config = JournalConfig.make({ path: "events.jsonl", shutdownPublishTimeout: Duration.seconds(2) });
