    66	 * **Example** (Describe a complete tail window)
    67	 *
    68	 * ```ts import.meta.vitest name="Describe a complete tail window"
    69	 * import { TailWindow } from "@beep/scratchpad/effected/jsonl/internal/tail";
    70	 * const window = TailWindow.make({text:"42\n",start:0,size:3,atFileStart:true});
    71	 * window.size // => 3
    72	 * ```
