   157	/**
   158	 * Decode complete records in a captured absolute byte range.
   159	 *
   160	 * **Details**
   161	 *
   162	 * A leading cursor fragment is discarded in bytes when requested, before strict
   163	 * UTF-8 decoding. Every byte after the final newline is withheld without decoding
