## DIRECTORY STRUCTURE PATTERNS

### Core Module Organization

```text
packages/effect/src/
├── encoding/             # Encoding utilities (Base64, Hex, etc.)
│   ├── Base64.ts
│   ├── Base64Url.ts
│   ├── EncodingError.ts
│   ├── Hex.ts
│   └── index.ts
├── internal/             # Private implementation details (~27 files)
│   ├── array.ts
│   ├── concurrency.ts
